{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-the-wilds","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"the-wilds-moringa-mansions-aldar-properties-dubailand","about":"The Wilds Moringa Mansions by Aldar Properties is an exclusive gated collection of 38 luxury residences nestled in The Wilds, Dubailand. These expansive 5 and 6-bedroom mansions are crafted with architectural excellence, featuring private swimming pools, landscaped gardens, and in-house elevators. Designed in partnership with Nabil Gholam Architects, the mansions offer panoramic views of lush green spaces and Central Park, seamlessly blending sophistication with the serenity of nature.Positioned within a highly coveted location and connected to major Dubai highways, this development offers residents both privacy and proximity. With just a 10% down payment and sustainable credentials including LEED Platinum and Fitwel 3-star certifications, Aldar Moringa Mansions at The Wilds Dubai ensures long-term value, eco-conscious living, and a lifestyle defined by thoughtful luxury and modern convenience.","price":39000000,"title":"The Wilds Moringa Mansions","bitrix":{"id":1222,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"The Wilds Moringa Mansions","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"The Wilds Moringa Mansions","property_type":"Mansion","developer_name":"Aldar Properties","project_location":"Dubailand"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/The_Wilds_Moringa_Mansions_by_Aldar_Properties_219fe804cb.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/The_Wilds_Moringa_Mansions_by_Aldar_Properties_219fe804cb.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":25.0910411,"lng":55.3784577},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/the_wilds_g_1_7180e094f8.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/the_wilds_g_1_7180e094f8.webp"},{"340x252":"https://