uring pond, lawn, and dry stream habitats.  The signature ‘Nest’ clubhouse, wildlife observation areas, and environmental learning spaces make this community a haven for families and nature lovers. With a premium international school, sports facilities, wellness pavilions, and interactive play zones, The Wilds is where luxury meets mindful living—an inspiring retreat where nature and modern comfort thrive together.","price":5100000,"title":"The Wilds","bitrix":{"id":1136,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"The Wilds","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"The Wilds","property_type":"Villas","developer_name":"Aldar Properties","project_location":"Dubailand"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/The_Wilds_by_Aldar_Properties_705518112e.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/The_Wilds_by_Aldar_Properties_705518112e.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":25.0910411,"lng":55.3784577},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/the_wilds_g_2_26db59ea0b.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/the_wilds_g_2_26db59ea0b.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/the_wilds_g_7_e1be5fc495.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/the_wilds_g_7_e1be5fc495.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/the_wilds_g_8_eef0198ca9.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/the_wilds_g_8_eef0198ca9.webp"}],"images2":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/The_Wilds_by_Aldar_Properties_705518112e.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/The_Wilds_by_Aldar_Properties_705518112e.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/the_wilds_g_2_26db59ea0b.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/the_wilds_g_2_26db59ea0b.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/